The "zlib/zlib" subfolder's contents were written by Jean-loup Gailly
and Mark Adler and are used by permission.  See the file 
zlib/zlib/README for details.

The "delphi" subfolder's contents were written by Matthew Emson,
and are used by permission.  See the file delphi/licence-delphi.txt
for details.

